WEBVTT

00:45.128 --> 00:47.130
Blood traces on the arrowhead.

00:48.047 --> 00:51.760
So Kamo's cursed technique
defies the laws of physics?

00:53.428 --> 00:56.890
You can summon another shikigami
at the same time, right?

00:57.474 --> 01:00.727
It doesn't feel nice
to know you're holding back.

01:01.436 --> 01:04.230
Divine Dog is busy at work.

01:05.065 --> 01:07.484
Likewise.
You're left with one arrow, right?

01:08.109 --> 01:10.445
I won't save you
even if you collapse from anemia.

01:11.780 --> 01:13.531
Blood Manipulation.

01:13.615 --> 01:16.576
It can control one's own blood
and objects attached to it.

01:17.202 --> 01:20.538
A fitting cursed technique
from one of the Great Families.

01:21.706 --> 01:23.166
Don't worry.

01:23.666 --> 01:26.878
I've prepared these in advance.

01:27.462 --> 01:29.172
Ten Shadows Technique.

01:29.672 --> 01:32.550
A cursed technique
passed down in the Zenin Family.

01:32.634 --> 01:35.595
One can summon ten shikigami
using shadows as a medium.

01:36.179 --> 01:39.224
If only Maki and Mai inherited it…

01:51.402 --> 01:53.446
Was he this strong?

01:55.698 --> 01:57.450
I didn't expect you to react to it.

01:58.493 --> 02:00.203
Don't let down your guard.

02:07.752 --> 02:09.671
My cursed energy defense was late.

02:10.171 --> 02:13.216
His speed and strength
are completely different from before.

02:15.260 --> 02:17.428
Blood Manipulation is not just about

02:17.512 --> 02:19.681
manipulating shapes or movement.

02:20.682 --> 02:22.809
It can even control body temperature,

02:22.892 --> 02:27.147
pulse rate,
and the number of red blood cells freely.

02:29.065 --> 02:30.608
Flowing Red Scale.

02:31.651 --> 02:33.027
Doping?

02:33.111 --> 02:34.571
Great observation.

02:35.071 --> 02:37.740
But please refrain from using that word.

04:16.422 --> 04:18.424
My katana

04:18.508 --> 04:22.178
Was taken away

04:23.680 --> 04:26.683
I wonder where Mai's sister is.

04:26.766 --> 04:28.893
She's fast.

04:29.477 --> 04:34.691
Well, it's true that I won't be able
to fight without my katana.

04:35.566 --> 04:38.194
Is bubble tea really that good?

04:42.031 --> 04:43.241
It's Mechamaru.

04:44.951 --> 04:48.121
Hello. I'm Miwa, the useless one.

04:48.204 --> 04:49.539
Sleep.

04:52.542 --> 04:53.626
ULTIMATE MECHAMARU

04:54.460 --> 04:57.380
KYOTO SISTER-SCHOOL GOODWILL EVENT
KASUMI MIWA WITHDRAWS

05:01.467 --> 05:03.886
KASUMI MIWA

05:10.268 --> 05:11.311
Return.

05:26.409 --> 05:28.453
She fell asleep.

05:29.412 --> 05:30.872
I'll head over.

05:30.955 --> 05:31.789
What?

05:32.290 --> 05:36.044
I can't leave her in the forest
with Cursed Spirits, right?

05:41.841 --> 05:43.009
What is this?

05:43.593 --> 05:47.221
A Semi-Grade 1 Cursed Spirit
that will be released in the zone.

05:47.847 --> 05:50.058
Not a Grade 2 Cursed Spirit?

05:50.141 --> 05:53.102
A Grade 2 isn't assuring enough.

05:53.186 --> 05:54.145
What?

05:54.645 --> 05:58.191
Our own people are disorganized.

05:58.775 --> 06:02.195
This is the scent and whistle
used to control it.

06:02.779 --> 06:07.200
If possible, use it and kill Itadori.

06:07.283 --> 06:10.286
It might get eliminated before I use it.

06:10.787 --> 06:12.580
Don't worry.

06:12.663 --> 06:16.751
It's trained to not take action
before you sound the whistle.

06:19.295 --> 06:20.838
Kamo is good.

06:20.922 --> 06:22.924
He must have smeared the scent on Itadori

06:23.007 --> 06:26.636
when the video feed was disrupted.

06:27.428 --> 06:31.390
Once he mixes it in his blood,
then it will be easy.

06:33.101 --> 06:37.188
If Itadori is fighting Todo,
he won't get away with just a scratch.

06:37.271 --> 06:42.860
If the Semi-Grade 1 Cursed Spirit
attacks him after that…

06:42.944 --> 06:45.196
He would be dead for sure.

06:45.947 --> 06:47.323
That's right.

06:47.406 --> 06:51.285
I'm worried about Miwa too.
Hurry up and go.

06:59.210 --> 07:00.419
Kelp.

07:36.539 --> 07:39.792
Salmon, salmon roe, spiced cod roe.

07:44.255 --> 07:45.506
All right.

07:46.841 --> 07:49.051
We should get to work too.

07:49.802 --> 07:51.804
Let's make a clothing rack.

07:51.888 --> 07:54.724
Satoru Gojo's at least 190cm tall, right?

07:54.807 --> 07:57.727
He'll make a good clothing rack.

08:06.277 --> 08:09.447
Why does everyone bully you, Mother?

08:10.448 --> 08:13.117
Because I'm an illegitimate mistress.

08:13.201 --> 08:16.454
Then why take special care of me?

08:17.079 --> 08:19.707
Why bring me here pretending
that I'm the eldest son?

08:20.208 --> 08:22.877
Because his wife
couldn't give birth to a son

08:22.960 --> 08:25.630
capable of inheriting
his cursed technique.

08:26.214 --> 08:29.759
Then as the next head of the Kamo Family…

09:01.916 --> 09:06.128
It's rare to find a shikigami user
who's flexible in close combat.

09:06.212 --> 09:07.797
You've improved.

09:07.880 --> 09:09.340
I'm happy for you.

09:09.924 --> 09:13.344
Why are you acting familiar with me
from time to time?

09:13.928 --> 09:15.846
It's sympathy.

09:15.930 --> 09:19.600
You'll be the pillar supporting
the Great Families in the future.

09:22.436 --> 09:25.648
I'm going to kill Yuji Itadori.

09:27.483 --> 09:29.860
Is that Principal Gakuganji's order?

09:30.611 --> 09:33.531
No, it's my own will.

09:33.614 --> 09:36.450
As a member of the Kamo Family,

09:36.534 --> 09:38.953
I think this is the right decision.

09:40.413 --> 09:44.166
I must act and behave like
the eldest son of the Kamo Family.

09:45.001 --> 09:46.460
It's for Mother's sake.

09:47.920 --> 09:50.006
You should understand it too.

09:50.965 --> 09:53.217
Because we're the same.

09:54.218 --> 09:55.511
No way.

09:56.012 --> 09:57.972
He's saying some scary stuff suddenly.

09:59.432 --> 10:00.891
It's true.

10:00.975 --> 10:02.852
No, it's not.

10:02.935 --> 10:05.479
Tell that to Maki.

10:06.480 --> 10:10.401
I'm no longer connected
to the Zenin Family.

10:11.193 --> 10:15.239
Besides, I don't think I'm right.

10:15.990 --> 10:17.658
No, sorry.

10:18.159 --> 10:19.368
It's wrong.

10:19.952 --> 10:23.748
It doesn't matter
whether I'm right or not.

10:24.790 --> 10:28.502
I only believe in my own conscience.

10:29.712 --> 10:32.715
Helping others
according to my own conscience.

10:34.133 --> 10:37.803
If someone denies me of that…

10:40.640 --> 10:43.684
All that's left is to curse that person.

10:46.520 --> 10:47.938
A Shikigami?

10:49.148 --> 10:50.650
There was one left?

10:52.860 --> 10:55.154
It was about to run out,
and he used it as bait?

10:57.490 --> 11:01.243
This one consumes a lot of cursed energy
and can only be used alone.

11:01.327 --> 11:03.788
I just purified it recently.

11:04.872 --> 11:06.040
Max Elephant.

11:15.383 --> 11:16.967
That's a huge target.

11:17.051 --> 11:18.052
I must act first!

11:22.098 --> 11:23.015
Water?

11:25.976 --> 11:28.104
I'm swept away
by the water and its pressure!

11:28.187 --> 11:29.563
It's dangerous in a wide area.

11:29.647 --> 11:31.107
He'll use that trick.

11:35.694 --> 11:36.612
Nue.

11:45.788 --> 11:49.291
I'll only hinder you if I'm around.

11:49.834 --> 11:51.043
I…

11:51.794 --> 11:53.462
Blood Manipulation!

11:57.508 --> 11:58.884
Crimson Binding!

12:01.762 --> 12:04.974
I'm not going to lose!

12:07.893 --> 12:08.811
-What?
-What?

12:10.396 --> 12:11.730
What's that?

12:13.441 --> 12:14.733
Inumaki!

12:15.943 --> 12:17.486
Run away now!

12:26.662 --> 12:27.580
What?

12:27.663 --> 12:28.581
What?

12:29.415 --> 12:30.374
What…

12:31.834 --> 12:33.711
Has the game ended?

12:33.794 --> 12:35.671
And they are all red flames…

12:36.672 --> 12:40.259
That's weird.
The crows didn't see anything.

12:41.719 --> 12:44.180
I wish I could say
that they were exorcised by

12:44.263 --> 12:46.849
the Great Teacher Gojo's students…

12:46.932 --> 12:50.853
An unregistered cursed energy
ignites a red flame as well.

12:51.437 --> 12:55.191
Outsiders? You mean intruders?

12:55.691 --> 12:58.903
Has Master Tengen's barrier failed?

12:58.986 --> 13:01.864
Intruders or not,

13:01.947 --> 13:04.867
this is still an emergency.

13:05.659 --> 13:09.622
Being able to eliminate that
means the opponent's quite strong.

13:10.456 --> 13:11.957
Who could it be?

13:13.292 --> 13:15.419
I'll go see Master Tengen.

13:16.670 --> 13:19.590
Satoru, protect Principal Gakuganji
and the students.

13:19.673 --> 13:23.344
Mei Mei, stay here and locate the students

13:23.427 --> 13:26.472
and then report it to Satoru
and the others.

13:26.555 --> 13:28.307
Understood.

13:28.390 --> 13:30.601
I look forward to the bonus.

13:31.936 --> 13:33.729
Come on, Grandpa!

13:33.812 --> 13:35.606
It's time for a walk.

13:35.689 --> 13:37.942
You've eaten lunch just now, right?

13:39.944 --> 13:41.237
Let's hurry.

13:53.541 --> 13:54.542
What?

14:01.632 --> 14:02.716
What?

14:03.717 --> 14:05.803
What a big fuss.

14:06.387 --> 14:11.892
However, when Cursed Spirits die,
nothing else remains.

14:12.977 --> 14:17.273
Nothing can be made out of it.

14:20.234 --> 14:22.278
Will this do?

14:22.862 --> 14:24.905
Right, and that too.

14:26.365 --> 14:30.035
"Emerge from darkness,
that which is darker than black."

14:30.119 --> 14:32.872
"Purify this impurity."

14:36.417 --> 14:38.502
All right!

14:39.336 --> 14:43.257
I look forward to the clothing rack.

15:04.069 --> 15:06.238
A Veil? Why is it appearing now?

15:08.282 --> 15:09.408
Gojo!

15:09.491 --> 15:12.494
Go in first before the Veil fully forms!

15:12.995 --> 15:15.080
-No, I can't do that.
-What?

15:15.581 --> 15:17.917
Actually, the Veil
has been formed completely.

15:18.417 --> 15:21.921
It seems to prioritize effects
over visual.

15:22.421 --> 15:23.547
They are good.

15:29.094 --> 15:32.222
Well, since it has been set up,

15:32.306 --> 15:33.974
I just need to tear it apart.

15:40.814 --> 15:43.275
What's this strange feeling?

15:43.359 --> 15:44.902
Wait a minute.

15:45.486 --> 15:49.907
Why were you pushed back, but not me?

15:55.120 --> 15:56.455
I see.

15:58.207 --> 16:01.001
Utahime and Grandpa.

16:01.085 --> 16:02.378
This Veil…

16:03.003 --> 16:06.131
is made specifically
to keep Satoru Gojo out

16:06.215 --> 16:09.718
while letting other sorcerers
enter and leave.

16:10.219 --> 16:11.387
What?

16:12.179 --> 16:15.224
He's right. That makes sense.

16:15.724 --> 16:19.728
But for someone to set up
a specific barrier like this means that…

16:20.229 --> 16:22.856
They are highly-skilled Curse Users.

16:23.357 --> 16:26.986
Not only that, but he also has a fair
amount of information on Jujutsu High.

16:28.070 --> 16:29.780
Come on. Hurry up and go.

16:30.280 --> 16:32.282
We don't know about their objective,

16:32.366 --> 16:34.910
but it's our loss if someone dies.

16:43.419 --> 16:46.046
What a strong curse aura!

16:46.130 --> 16:48.757
Don't tell me
a Special Grade Curse Spirit is here.

16:48.841 --> 16:51.343
Hey.

16:51.427 --> 16:54.346
Hey!

16:54.972 --> 16:57.808
Satoru Gojo isn't here!

16:58.642 --> 17:00.102
A Curse User?

17:00.185 --> 17:02.229
He's not the master of this aura,

17:02.312 --> 17:04.815
but he's quite strong.

17:05.399 --> 17:08.819
How dare that stupid monk lie to me.

17:08.902 --> 17:11.613
Utahime, you may continue on first.

17:11.697 --> 17:16.201
Prioritize the students' safety
and try to avoid a fight.

17:17.536 --> 17:22.124
Wait a minute.
Let me kill that woman at least!

17:22.207 --> 17:26.462
I can't make anything with an old man's
brittle bones and wrinkled skin!

17:28.130 --> 17:30.466
Whether I have brittle bones or not…

17:32.760 --> 17:35.637
You can confirm it by killing me!

17:36.221 --> 17:40.559
Come back after
drinking your milk, old man.

17:50.694 --> 17:53.155
Why would a Cursed Spirit be in school?

17:53.238 --> 17:54.782
Who cast this Veil?

17:55.449 --> 17:58.285
Probably a Curse User
who cooperates with Cursed Spirits.

18:00.204 --> 18:01.663
You know something?

18:02.790 --> 18:05.626
These are unregistered
Special Grade Curses.

18:05.709 --> 18:08.754
It seems like
they are cooperating with humans.

18:09.379 --> 18:13.634
I think it might be the Special Grade
Cursed Spirit that attacked Mr. Gojo.

18:14.134 --> 18:16.261
Even its appearance fits the report.

18:17.304 --> 18:19.556
I can tell even with his drawing.

18:22.392 --> 18:23.393
You're right.

18:23.894 --> 18:25.646
Let's contact Mr. Gojo.

18:26.146 --> 18:27.564
Wait a minute.

18:28.232 --> 18:31.443
You can understand him?

18:31.527 --> 18:33.612
That's not important right now.

18:34.279 --> 18:36.657
The opponent might know
how to use a Domain.

18:36.740 --> 18:39.451
We have to stay away and retreat--

18:43.205 --> 18:44.665
Stop!

18:49.336 --> 18:51.171
Blood Manipulation…

18:51.672 --> 18:52.548
Slicing Exorcism!

18:56.260 --> 18:57.678
It's not effective at all?

19:07.563 --> 19:10.065
Its skin is really tough!

19:12.192 --> 19:13.193
That katana…

19:14.361 --> 19:16.488
Where was he hiding it?

19:20.784 --> 19:23.745
Stop it, foolish children.

19:26.081 --> 19:27.332
What's this?

19:27.416 --> 19:31.044
It's speaking in a foreign language,
but I can understand it.

19:31.587 --> 19:33.422
This feels gross.

19:34.047 --> 19:38.177
I merely wish to protect this planet.

19:38.760 --> 19:41.388
Don't listen to its nonsense.

19:41.889 --> 19:44.933
It's not the same as those
low-level Cursed Spirits.

19:46.018 --> 19:48.395
The forest, ocean, and sky…

19:48.478 --> 19:51.148
They cry out in pain,
saying they can't bear it anymore.

19:51.815 --> 19:55.444
They can no longer coexist with humans.

19:56.195 --> 20:00.741
They know that some humans
are kind to this planet,

20:00.824 --> 20:04.411
but how much can that kindness
make up for?

20:05.621 --> 20:08.457
It has its own language system.

20:09.166 --> 20:12.961
All they want is time.

20:14.129 --> 20:15.797
Ask Inumaki to retreat.

20:17.257 --> 20:22.221
If there's enough time,
this planet can shine again.

20:31.605 --> 20:34.233
A time without humans.

20:35.525 --> 20:38.570
Die, and become a sage.

22:11.788 --> 22:13.373
-Juju Stroll.
-Juju Stroll.

22:17.085 --> 22:19.379
Hey, Jogo!

22:20.172 --> 22:22.674
You burned Hanami's flower bed again!

22:22.758 --> 22:24.760
Hanami is crying.

22:31.099 --> 22:32.517
Hanami.

22:32.601 --> 22:36.146
Why don't we just kill Jogo?

22:36.730 --> 22:42.235
My boyfriend's senior
is in that line of business.

22:42.819 --> 22:45.238
No, it's not that serious.

23:11.515 --> 23:13.350
Is this…

23:13.433 --> 23:14.935
slash-and-burn farming?

23:15.435 --> 23:19.731
Was it because the old soil
had insufficient nutrients?

23:34.913 --> 23:36.373
My heart is touched.
